# Agent Router

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` as the highest-authority workspace contract.

When user intent matches a tagged command in `AGENTS.md`, start that file
immediately. Do not wait for another prompt.

Canonical skills live in `references/skills/`. Cursor wrappers live in
`.cursor/skills/`. Load the matching wrapper, then follow the repo skill it
names.

Do not invent product claims. Do not write `flow.md` until the user approves
full slide copy.
